### Contoh request manual (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client).
### Variabel {{host}} ada di http-client.env.json.

### Registrasi
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "eko@example.com", "password": "rahasia123", "name": "Eko"}

### Login: salin access_token dan refresh_token dari respons
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "eko@example.com", "password": "rahasia123"}

### Refresh token (rotasi: token lama tidak bisa dipakai lagi)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"}

### Profil
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/_current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ubah nama (kirim version terakhir yang dibaca)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/users/_current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Eko Baru", "version": 1}

### Ganti password (wajib password lama; semua refresh token dicabut)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/users/_current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"current_password": "rahasia123", "new_password": "passwordbaru", "version": 2}

### Upload avatar (hanya bila storage aktif)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/users/_current/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./avatar.png
--boundary--

### Buat kontak
POST {{host}}/api/v1/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"first_name": "Budi", "last_name": "Santoso", "email": "budi@example.com", "phone": "08123456789"}

### Cari kontak
GET {{host}}/api/v1/contacts?name=bud&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ubah kontak (PUT = penggantian penuh; version wajib)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"first_name": "Budi", "last_name": "S.", "email": "budi@example.com", "phone": "08123456789", "version": 1}

### Hapus kontak (soft delete, ikut menghapus alamatnya)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Tambah alamat
POST {{host}}/api/v1/contacts/{{contactId}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"street": "Jl. Merdeka 1", "city": "Bandung", "province": "Jawa Barat", "postal_code": "40111", "country": "Indonesia"}

### Daftar user (khusus admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ubah role user (khusus admin)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role": "admin", "version": 1}

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"}
